{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Hear.</b> These are the words of the prophet." "<b>From afar.</b> Those who dwell in a distant land, or \"from afar\" concerning the future." "<b>From the womb He called me.</b> I will explain it in the book of Jeremiah."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:37.907057432Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}